### 5. Monitoring Domains & Metrics

**A. Operational (Signal)**
- Latency (p50, p95, p99)
- Error / Failure rate
- Throughput
- Token usage & cost
- Dependency health

**B. Quality & Trust (Evaluation)**
- Faithfulness / Groundedness
- Hallucination rate
- Relevance, Coherence, Completeness
- Toxicity / Safety score
- PII leakage rate
- Refusal / Abstention rate
- User override rate

**C. Drift & Stability**
- Data drift (PSI, CSI, distribution shifts)
- Prediction / Score drift
- Embedding drift
- Concept drift

**D. Fairness**
- Demographic parity
- Equalized odds
- Disparate impact
- Segment performance gaps

**E. Agent-Specific**
- Tool selection accuracy
- Trajectory success rate
- Autonomy boundary adherence
- Human hand-off frequency

